* STT-MRAM p-MTJ Switching Testbench (P -> AP -> P)
.control
pre_osdi ../models/mtj_pma.osdi
tran 0.01n 40n 0 0.01n uic

* Export clean white-background SVG
set hcopydevtype=svg
set color0=white
set color1=black
set color2=blue
set color3=red
set xbrushwidth=3
hardcopy ../docs/switching_waveform.svg v(in) v(mz)

* Show interactive plot
plot v(in) v(mz)
.endc

* Bipolar write pulse: +1.0 V (5ns-15ns) to write AP, -1.0 V (25ns-35ns) to write P
Vin in 0 PWL(0n 0 4.9n 0 5n 1.0 15n 1.0 15.1n 0 24.9n 0 25n -1.0 35n -1.0 35.1n 0 40n 0)

* Instantiate p-MTJ device
Nmtj in 0 mz mtj_pma

.model mtj_pma mtj_pma init_state=0
.end